# QA (M2 route flow, D-042/D-043/D-047): the whole M2 journey in one run of
# the real game. Title -> Salzburg (solver route, Maibaum 1772) -> route map
# (auto-continue) -> St. Gilgen (solver route from 2926, Maibaum 4649) -> map
# (auto) -> Brunnwinkl (solver route from 5681; the 100th Oblate on the way
# gives +1 life, counter 79 -> 1) -> Maibaum 7154 -> map from 7648: START in
# Arrive (7660) skips the walk straight to the Teaser (Resi on Falkenstein,
# „Fortsetzung folgt …"), START in the Teaser (7700) is ignored, the 180
# teaser frames end on the title (7840) with the run reset to Salzburg (score
# 0, 3 lives, 0 Oblaten, Normal); START (7900) starts the Salzburg intro.
level  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1772..1772 deaths=0 no_event=Died event=ExtraLife event=CheckpointReached
expect = state=stage_intro stage=salzburg score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0
